+/*
+ * EL1 virtual timer PPI: 27 on redwood, as the architecture suggests, but the SoC decides. On the
+ * BALMUDA Phone (SM7250) its device tree has the timer on PPI 3, INTID 19. Boot-arg vtimer_intid=N
